message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite both the software itself and the
  JOSS article (see preferred-citation).
type: software
title: "pysewer: A Python Library for Sewer Network Generation in Data Scarce Regions"
abstract: >-
  Pysewer is a sewer network generator for planning wastewater collection
  and treatment in data-scarce regions. Based on roads, building locations,
  and elevation data, it generates fully connected sewer networks that
  connect all buildings to one or several wastewater treatment plant
  locations, prioritising gravity flow and placing lifting or pumping
  stations with pressurised pipes where necessary.
